		{
			"id":"b3200ffa7ccd339c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"TENDER CIPHER = THE RED PRINCE\nUNCLE AWE = A NEW CLUE\nDRAFT THE SIXES = THE FIXED STARS\nLUNAR RENAMED = REALM AND RUNE\n\nASSUME THAT PAGE COUNT STARTS ON TITLE PAGES",
